LOAD  03020304           1      3.5                           STD   CONC3      1
LOAD  03040302           1      5.                            STD   CONC3      1
     IDENTIFICATION OF THE BASIC AND COMBINED LOADING CONDITIONS                
                   APPEARING ON THE FOLLOWING PAGES                             
LOAD CONDITION I = COMBINED LOADING CONDITION I                                 
L J = BASIC LOADING CONDITION J                                                 
K J = PORTION OF BASIC LOADING CONDITION J CONTRIBUTING TO COMBINED             
     LOADING CONDITION I                                                        
COMBINED LOADING CONDITION I CONSISTS OF (K1)(L1)+(K2)(L2)+(K3)(L3)             
     +(K4)(L4)                                                                  
BASIC LOADING CONDITION DESCRIPTION                                             
     L1 = DEAD LOAD                                                             
     L2 = WIND, WEST TO EAST                                                    
     L3 = WIND, SOUTH TO NORTH                                                  
COMBINED LOADING CONDITION DESCRIPTION                                          
     LOAD CONDITION 1(DEAD LOAD) = (1.0)(L1)                                    
     LOAD CONDITION 2(DEAD LOAD+WIND, WEST TO EAST) =                           
          (1.0)(L1)+(1.0)(L2)                                                   
     LOAD CONDITION 3(DEAD LOAD+WIND, SOUTH TO NORTH) =                         
          (1.0)(L1)+(1.0)(L3)                                                   
END                                                                             
